<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PalEx started strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PalEx started strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it started coverage of PalEx Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown acted as lead underwriter for PalEx's initial public offering, launched in late March.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 8-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
